#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:157
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solução de Problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Gateway unreachable:** Verify the Gateway URL is accessible from the "
"|morpheus| appliance and from end-user browsers"
msgstr "**Gateway unreachable:** Verifique se a Gateway URL está acessível a partir do appliance |morpheus| e dos navegadores dos usuários finais"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:160
msgid ""
"**Authentication failed:** Ensure the API Key configured on the gateway "
"service matches the one generated in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**Authentication failed:** Certifique-se de que a API Key configurada no serviço de gateway corresponde à gerada no |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:161
msgid ""
"**Cannot delete gateway:** Remove the gateway assignment from all VDI "
"Pools first"
msgstr "**Cannot delete gateway:** Remova primeiro a atribuição do gateway de todos os VDI Pools"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Sessions not routing through gateway:** Verify the pool has the gateway"
" assigned and that the gateway service is running"
msgstr "**Sessions not routing through gateway:** Verifique se o pool tem o gateway atribuído e se o serviço de gateway está em execução"

